{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "308c5ceb-eda4-8f6a-9c75-4d3a2406a17e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T11:04:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine, how can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is George Thurston. I call about the drain on Thames Street. Again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Thurston. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "694 Thames Street. In the Fifth Ward. It is my father's house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "694 Thames Street. Got it. And what's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I called Saturday, after the storm. Friday into Saturday, the big one. The lady told me a crew comes Monday. Okay. Today the crew comes, ten o'clock. They pull some leaves, one plastic bag from the grate at the corner. Five minutes. Then they leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So they cleared the corner grate this morning and left."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And the water is still there. Right now. In front of the house the water is up to the curb. It covers half the road. Half. Cars go around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Water up to the curb, across half the road, in front of 694. Is any of it getting into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. No, the house is fine. Nothing inside. This is the street. Only the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, okay. So the street's not draining even after they cleaned the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Look. I work outside, I know water. The whole block goes down to the corner. All the water from the street, it goes there. And the grate, it still looks plugged. Something is under. They take the bag off the top, very nice, but the water does not go down. So what did they fix? Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:02:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me pull up Saturday's ticket. [pause] Okay, I see it. Catch basin backup, 694 Thames. And there's a note the crew was out this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. This morning. And now I call again. I want somebody to come and really clean it. Today. Not the top only. Right away, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm putting in a new order that the corner basin is still holding water after the grate was cleared, and the water's at curb height across half the road. The crew we can get back there is tomorrow, Tuesday the thirteenth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Tuesday. Not today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not today, I'm sorry. After that storm they've got a long list. But it's on for tomorrow, the thirteenth, and I'm noting that the grate was already done and it's still backed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you say it again, please? To be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 694 Thames Street. Corner catch basin still plugged after this morning's visit, water up to the curb over half the road. Crew comes Tuesday, January thirteenth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Tuesday. If they just take the leaves again, I call again Wednesday. I promise you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Is there a good number if they need you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My cell. 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I am in the store now. Electronics. I bring my old laptop to trade, they give me a little credit. Small, but okay. And they make me wait, so I call you while I wait. Everybody makes me wait today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[laughs] Well, I hope the store does better than we did. Anything else on the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Just send them tomorrow. And tell them, please, look under the grate. Not only the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that right in the notes. Under the grate, not just the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:03:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Thurston. Take care."
    }
  ],
